    <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="section" dg:origin="1 240 1228 2310 1951">
      <dg:chunk dg:structure="header" dg:origin="1 240 1228 1026 1271" dg:style="font-weight: bold; color: darkcyan">
        <dg:chunk dg:structure="lim" dg:origin="1 240 1228 277 1271">1.</dg:chunk> Financial and Operational Narrative</dg:chunk>
      <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1327 2310 1367; 1 240 1386 2310 1426; 1 240 1446 2310 1485; 1 240 1505 2310 1545; 1 240 1565 520 1604">Throughout the third quarter of 2146, the Ligeia Mare Hydrocarbon Subsurface Pipeline &amp; Liquefaction facility operated in complete compliance with all covenants and technical metrics detailed in the Secured Credit Agreement (Document 7A). The piping network maintained strong structural performance, posting a quarterly average Subsurface Pipeline Integrity Rating (SPIR) of <docset:CovenantThreshold xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="95.4" dg:origin="1 1143 1505 1266 1545">95.4%</docset:CovenantThreshold>, which exceeds the <docset:CovenantThreshold xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="90.0" dg:origin="1 1639 1505 1752 1545">90.0%</docset:CovenantThreshold> baseline standard specified in Section 4.01(1).</docset:OperationalNarrative>
      <docset:OperationalThroughputNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1674 2310 1713; 1 240 1733 2310 1773; 1 240 1793 2310 1832; 1 240 1852 2310 1892; 1 240 1911 1730 1951" xml:id="operationalthroughputnarrative" dg:itemprop="references" dg:href="#covenantthreshold">Liquid hydrocarbon transport volumes averaged <docset:ProjectedCommodityYield dg:origin="1 1124 1674 1441 1713">9,485 metric tons</docset:ProjectedCommodityYield> of liquefied compounds per Titan sidereal day, successfully achieving the Pipeline Throughput Target of <docset:CovenantThreshold dg:origin="1 1412 1733 1753 1773" xml:id="covenantthreshold">9,200 metric tons</docset:CovenantThreshold> outlined in Section 4.01(2). Consequently, the Facility Loans accrued interest at the baseline floating rate of <docset:InterestRate dg:origin="1 1669 1793 2226 1832" dg:style="font-weight: bold">TIDOR plus 7.25% per annum</docset:InterestRate>, with no triggers of the Pipeline Rupture Risk Premium. Additionally, our escrow balances in the Undersea Sediment Escrow were fully maintained at the required <docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve dg:origin="1 1041 1911 1327 1951">SC 450,000,000</docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve> under Section 4.01(3).</docset:OperationalThroughputNarrative>
    </docset:OperationalNarrative>
